---
// 首页留言小卡片：提交后带参数跳到留言板；预览与统计由 src/scripts/site/home.ts 拉取运行时接口。
---

<section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter pb-space-xl" id="guestbook">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg items-center bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-space-lg lg:p-space-xl shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Left Column: Invitation text -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">mark_email_unread</span>
        <span class="uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">时光信箱 · Letterbox</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-normal leading-snug">
        留下一枚字句，
        <br />
        像向大海投递一只漂流瓶。
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        若你也恰巧在某个静默的夜晚途经此处，欢迎留下近况、推荐一首近期陪伴你的好歌，或仅仅是一句简单的“见字如面”。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-space-md gap-y-1 pt-space-xs font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-secondary">lock</span>
          支持公开或仅博主可见
        </span>
        <span class="">·</span>
        <span data-stat-reply>回复率读取中…</span>
        <span class="">·</span>
        <span data-stat-total>来信统计读取中…</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Right Column: Interactive Mini Form & Recent Notes -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-space-md bg-surface-container p-space-lg rounded-lg">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg border border-surface-container-high/40 flex items-start gap-space-sm shadow-sm">
        <div
          class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center font-label-sm font-semibold shrink-0"
          data-preview-avatar
        >
          修
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-space-xs">
            <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium text-primary truncate" data-preview-name>
              修仙考研人 · 广州
            </span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
              <span
                class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-[0.625rem]"
                data-preview-badge
              >
                示例留言
              </span>
              <span class="font-label-sm text-[0.625rem] text-on-surface-variant" data-preview-time>
                {' '}
                今天 14:20{' '}
              </span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed" data-preview-message>
            “同在二刷《诡秘之主》！酷狗里开着蝰蛇音效听《大鱼》看网文真是一绝，强烈安利你去听听周深的现场版，氛围感拉满。”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <form class="flex flex-col gap-space-md pt-space-xs" id="home-letter-form">
        <input aria-hidden="true" autocomplete="off" class="hidden" name="website" tabindex="-1" type="text" />
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium">称呼 / 笔名</label>
            <input
              class="w-full bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-2 rounded text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-secondary"
              id="home-name"
              name="name"
              placeholder="例：远方的夜行者"
              type="text"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
            <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium">常驻城市 / 留声机单曲</label>
            <input
              class="w-full bg-surface-container-low px-space-md py-2 rounded text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-secondary"
              id="home-station"
              name="station"
              placeholder="例：成都 · 酷狗单曲《大鱼》 / 《诡秘之主》"
              type="text"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <label class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-medium">写下你想说的话...</label>
          <textarea
            class="w-full bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded text-body-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-secondary resize-none leading-relaxed"
            id="home-message"
            name="message"
            placeholder="说说你今天的夕阳，或是正在翻开的下一页..."
            rows="3"
          ></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-space-xs">
          <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant cursor-pointer select-none">
            <input class="accent-secondary rounded" id="home-private" name="private" type="checkbox" />
            <span class="">仅房主可见 (悄悄话模式)</span>
          </label>
          <button
            class="px-space-md py-2 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"
            type="submit"
          >
            <span class="">投递留言</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">send</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div
          class="hidden p-space-sm bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container rounded font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-space-xs shadow-sm"
          id="letter-toast"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">check_circle</span>
          <span class="">纸飞机已寄出！感谢你把一束微光照进书房。</span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
